# Reference asset — a covered wagon in side view, facing right.
#
# This one exists to establish house style for the larger sprites:
#   - black outline everywhere an edge meets transparency, one pixel thick
#   - white canvas bonnet, orange wagon body (the Apple II palette has no brown,
#     so orange stands in for timber — this is the substitution to reuse elsewhere)
#   - no anti-aliasing and no dithering; every pixel is one of the six colours
#
# Palette: . transparent, K black, W white, G green, V violet, O orange, B blue
name: wagon_reference
size: 32x20
pixels:
